<section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero__media" style="background-image:url('assets/img/ug-kibale.jpg')"></div>
    <div class="page-hero__scrim"></div>
    <div class="container page-hero__content">
      <p class="eyebrow eyebrow--light reveal">Uganda · Itinerary</p>
      <h1 class="reveal">Primates &amp; Big Game</h1>
      <div class="itin-meta reveal">
        <span><b>8 days</b></span>
        <span>Kibale · Queen Elizabeth · Bwindi</span>
        <span>Private &amp; tailor-made</span>
        <span>from <b>$6,900</b> / person</span>
      </div>
      <div class="hero__actions reveal" style="margin-top:1.6rem"><a href="contact.html?trip=Primates%20%26%20Big%20Game" class="btn btn--gold">Enquire about this trip</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="article reveal">
        <nav class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">Home</a> / <a href="uganda.html">Uganda</a> / Primates &amp; Big Game</nav>
        <p class="article__lead">Uganda's two great wildlife stories in one journey — the primates of the forests and the big game of the savanna. Chimpanzees in Kibale, lions and elephants in Queen Elizabeth, and the unforgettable mountain gorillas of Bwindi.</p>
        <p>Private and tailor-made, it balances forest treks with classic game drives and a boat safari, for the fullest taste of the "pearl of Africa".</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section__head reveal"><p class="eyebrow">Day by day</p><h2 class="section__title">Your 8-day journey</h2></div>
      <div class="days">
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 1</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Arrive in Entebbe</h3><p>Met at the airport and taken to a restful lake-shore hotel to settle in and meet your guide.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Entebbe lake hotel · <b>Meals:</b> Dinner</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 2</div><div class="day__body"><h3>To the Kibale forest</h3><p>A scenic drive west through tea estates and crater-lake country to your forest lodge near Kibale.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Kibale forest lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 3</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Chimpanzee trekking</h3><p>A morning among the chimpanzees of Kibale, then an afternoon Bigodi wetland walk alive with monkeys and birds.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Kibale forest lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 4</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Queen Elizabeth National Park</h3><p>Into Queen Elizabeth for an afternoon cruise on the Kazinga Channel, where elephant, buffalo and hippo crowd the banks beneath the Rwenzori.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Queen Elizabeth lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 5</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Ishasha &amp; tree-climbing lions</h3><p>A morning game drive, then south through the remote Ishasha sector in search of its famous tree-climbing lions on the way to gorilla country.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Bwindi forest lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 6</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Gorilla trekking in Bwindi</h3><p>The crescendo of the trip — a hike into the Bwindi Impenetrable Forest for a regulated hour with a mountain gorilla family.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Bwindi forest lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 7</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Bwindi at leisure</h3><p>A gentler day — a community or Batwa cultural walk, or simply rest among the birdsong before the journey home.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Stay:</b> Bwindi forest lodge · <b>Meals:</b> All</p></div></div>
        <div class="day reveal"><div class="day__num">Day 8</div><div class="day__body"><h3>Fly to Entebbe &amp; depart</h3><p>A light-aircraft flight back to Entebbe for your onward connection.</p><p class="day__stay"><b>Meals:</b> Breakfast</p></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

